Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_FT_rf"}

Thought: Test a trimmed_mean over all 19 models with 20% trimming to see if robust averaging improves on best_single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Evaluate a robust median over the most consistent models in pool1 to see if it beats the best_single baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

