Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a deterministic DBA over the small, stable pool1 to see if a focused barycenter improves on best_single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a robust deterministic median over the most stable pool2 to see if it beats best_single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Evaluate a dba strategy on the more stable pool3 to see if it beats best_single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the existing inverse-error weights handle on the full model pool to see if it outperforms the robust baselines.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Try a weighted combination using inverse error weights on the full pool to see if that improves over the current best_single.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test best_single with ARIMA to see if a different strong model beats ONLY_FT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse‑error combination restricted to the most stable pool2 to see if reducing noise from less stable models helps.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination over the most stable pool3 using inverse error weights to see if focusing on stable models improves over the current best single.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Try a weighted combo on pool3 using the existing weight handle w1 (inverse error) to see if a different pool improves over the current best_single.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"w1"}

